<node id="claim_pt_tunes_her_mechanism">
  <data key="d17">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d18">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d28">electronic-structure and kinetic mechanism</data>
  <data key="d29">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d30">mixed</data>
  <data key="d19">Mechanistic interpretation explicitly attributed to combined operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations.</data>
</node>
